        "sentence_id": "05d4db5461434d211bc694f66a0feddf",
        "sentence_text": " Argentina's first native born opera composer was Francisco Hargreaves (1849-1900) who composed \"La gatta bianca\" (1875) and \"Los estudiantes de Bologna\" (1897), followed by Zen\u00f3n Rol\u00f3n (1856-1902) who composed several operas as well as operettas and zarzuelas.",
