        "sentence_text": "The evolution of Richard Wagner's operatic tetralogy \"Der Ring des Nibelungen\" (\"The Ring of the Nibelung\") was a long and tortuous process, and the precise sequence of events which led the composer to embark upon such a vast undertaking is still unclear.",
