        "sentence_id": "17d4394e3c15b9e02021ee105cd59b79",
        "sentence_text": " The composition of the text took place between 1848 and 1853, when all four libretti were privately printed; but the closing scene of the final opera, \"G\u00f6tterd\u00e4mmerung\", was revised a number of times between 1856 and 1872.",
